[I] Socket library that provides several common communication patterns

[T] nanomsg is a simple high-performance C implementation of several
[T] scalability protocols, light-weight messaging patterns such as
[T] request/reply, publish/subscribe and surveyor/respondent. They run over
[T] transports such as TCP, UNIX sockets and WebSocket.

[U] https://nanomsg.org

